</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Additional experimental results</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Implementation Details</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We implement our approach for five state-of-the-art open-source models released after 2024:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">- Qwen2.5-14B-Coder <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2024)</a></cite>
- Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2024)</a></cite>
- DeepSeek-7B-Coder-v1.5 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Guo et al. (2024)</a></cite>
- Yi-1.5-9B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">AI et al. (2025)</a></cite>
- Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jiang et al. (2023)</a></cite></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For each model, we use a bottleneck dimension of <math id="A3.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=64</annotation></semantics></math> for all adapter modules, resulting in approximately 0.3% trainable parameters compared to the full model. We distribute adapters across transformer layers based on our three-level abstraction hierarchy.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="A3.T3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Implementation details.</span> Adapter configurations and training parameters for each model architecture.</figcaption>
